#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0031 expect=violation domain=CM
#note "The PMDA-SD0031 branch of the union trigger: every record is excepted on the PMDA-SD0022 branch (CMOCCUR='N' on both rows), but row 2 carries a populated CMENDTC with no start column in the dataset - exactly the state PMDA-SD0031 reports per record where the columns exist. One dataset-level finding."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset CM class=INTERVENTIONS label="Concomitant Medications"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col CMSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col CMTRT   type=Char label="Reported Name of Drug, Med, or Therapy"
col CMOCCUR type=Char label="CM Occurrence"
col CMSTAT  type=Char label="Completion Status"
col CMENDTC type=Char label="End Date/Time of Medication"
---
S1 | CM | 001 | 1 | ASPIRIN   | N |          |
S1 | CM | 001 | 2 | IBUPROFEN | N |          | 2023-04-05
